timestamp=2026-11-04T19:16:28.757Z level=INFO run=c2c30b4a message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\n\n# Explore dates grouped by calendar month vs by weekday alignment\ndates = []\nimport csv\nwith open('/app/dataset/timesheet.csv') as f:\n    for row in csv.DictReader(f):\n        try:\n            d = datetime.strptime(row['date'], '%Y-%m-%d')\n            dates.append(d)\n        except:\n            pass\n\ndates.sort()\n# Earliest: 2025-03-04 is Tuesday\n# Group by calendar month\nby_month = {}\nfor d in dates:\n    key = (d.year, d.month)\n    by_month.setdefault(key, []).append(d)\n\nfor k, v in sorted(by_month.items()):\n    print(k, 'count=', len(v), 'range:', v[0].day, '-', v[-1].day)\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
