timestamp=2026-11-04T19:23:03.814Z level=INFO run=c2c30b4a message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Correct by replacing 31 with 30 for months with 30 days\nfrom datetime import datetime\nimport calendar\n\ndef fix_date(s):\n    try:\n        return datetime.strptime(s, '%Y-%m-%d')\n    except Exception as e:\n        # try to parse manually\n        parts = s.split('-')\n        if len(parts) != 3: return None\n        y, m, d = int(parts[0]), int(parts[1]), int(parts[2])\n        # clamp to last day of month\n        last = calendar.monthrange(y, m)[1]\n        if d > last:\n            d = last\n        try:\n            return datetime(y, m, d)\n        except:\n            return None\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
